@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title State Machine Diagram - Service Execution Lifecycle v1.2

[*] --> BelumDimulai : service execution is recorded for a Visit
BelumDimulai --> SedangDilaksanakan : authorized staff starts the service
SedangDilaksanakan --> Selesai : service result is recorded and completed

Selesai --> [*]

note right of BelumDimulai
  Each PelaksanaanLayanan represents one recorded service
  performed or planned within a Visit.
  The execution status is independent from Visit status.
end note

note bottom
  State names are proposed modeling values.
  Confirm allowed transitions and responsible roles with stakeholders.
  A service execution update must not overwrite Visit, Booking,
  Invoice, or Payment status. Cancellation/hold states are not defined here.
end note
@enduml
